OL,3,GNEWSAPlanning permission refused for
OL,4,A'eyesore' site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car and tyre storage site built
OL,7,Fwithout permission has been refused
OL,8,Fretrospective planning approval.
OL,10,FThe site, on North Street in
OL,11,FGainsborough, Lincolnshire, was opened
OL,12,Flast year and described by locals as an
OL,13,F"eyesore".
OL,15,FCouncillors unanimously voted not to
OL,16,Fgrant planning permission on visual
OL,17,Fimpact and safety grounds at a meeting
OL,18,Fon Wednesday.
OL,20,FHowever, the West Lindsey District
OL,21,FCouncil meeting was told that the site
OL,22,F"wouldn't be fixed tomorrow".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
